1
00:00:00,979 --> 00:00:02,949
(Raj:)...just reminds me too much of India.

2
00:00:04,183 --> 00:00:07,273
I haven't been since I was a kid.
We should go one weekend.

3
00:00:07,453 --> 00:00:08,683
(Bernadette:)Weekends are too crowded.

4
00:00:08,854 --> 00:00:11,684
- So blow off work, go on a weekday.
- Hooky?

5
00:00:11,857 --> 00:00:14,017
(Amy:)I've never played hooky in my life.

6
00:00:14,193 --> 00:00:18,183
(Amy:)My mom said that's how girls end up
addicted to reefer and jazz music.

7
00:00:20,199 --> 00:00:22,789
(Penny:)More like how girls end up
at a Best Western hotel...

8
00:00:22,968 --> 00:00:25,668
(Penny:)...with a 34-year-old guy named Luther.

9
00:00:27,606 --> 00:00:30,736
- Joke?
- I can laugh about it now.

10
00:00:34,179 --> 00:00:37,239
(Bernadette:)What do you say? This Friday
we ditch work and go to Disneyland?

11
00:00:37,416 --> 00:00:39,646
- I'm in.
- Me too.

12
00:00:39,818 --> 00:00:43,258
(Raj:)Excuse me, I thought we were
trying to solve my problem.

13
00:00:43,422 --> 00:00:44,822
(Penny:)Oh, yeah, right.

14
00:00:44,990 --> 00:00:47,120
(Penny:)Wait, what was your problem again?

15
00:00:47,359 --> 00:00:51,559
I'm a man who can't talk to women, trying
to figure out how to go on a romantic date...

16
00:00:51,730 --> 00:00:57,030
...with a girl who suffers from social
anxiety, she can't be around other people.

17
00:00:57,569 --> 00:01:01,019
(Penny:)Yeah, that's a toughie.

